BCC1997 modern Fortran port

This project is a derivative work of the R package BCC1997 0.1.1.

Original package:
  Copyright (C) 2017 Haoran Zhang
  License: GPL version 2 or later

The original package implements the universal European option-pricing
solution described by Bakshi, Cao, and Chen (1997), DOI:
10.1111/j.1540-6261.1997.tb02749.x.

The modern Fortran translation is distributed under the same
GPL-2.0-or-later terms. The original package and the supplied source archive
are retained unmodified under original/ and provenance/.
